e module with the name from httpd_service variable.\n\nI need to make sure each task is correctly ordered and uses the right modules and variables. Also, I\'ll ensure that the YAML syntax is correct, adhering to yamllint and ansible-lint standards. Since this is for an Ansible Role, I won\'t include any playbook-level headers like hosts or vars.\n\nLet me structure each task with the correct module calls, conditions, and notifications. I\'ll double-check the file paths and variables to ensure they match the given descriptions.\n\nI think that\'s all. Time to put it all together in the YAML format.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Task 1: Import assert.yml\n  include_tasks: assert.yml\n  run_once: true\n  when: ansible_hostname == \'localhost\'\n\n- name: Task 2: Install apache httpd\n  apt:\n    name: "{{ httpd_packages }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Task 3: Configure selinux\n  selinux:\n    state: "{{ selinux_enabled | default(\'enforcing\') }}"\n    persistent: true\n  when: selinux_enabled is defined\n  register: selinux_status\n\n  selport:\n    port: "{{ item }}"\n    proto: tcp\n    state: present\n  when: selinux_enabled is defined and httpd_port or httpd_ssl_port\n  with_items:\n    - "{{ httpd_port }}"\n    - "{{ httpd_ssl_port }}"\n\n- name: Task 4: Configure httpd\n  template:\n    src: "{{ httpd_config_src }}"\n    dest: "{{ httpd_config_dest }}"\n    mode: 0644\n  notify: test httpd configuration and restart httpd\n\n- name: Task 5: Activate httpd module | Debian\n  shell: "{{ item.cmd }} {{ item.module }}"\n  with_items: "{{ httpd_modules_to_activate_with_command }}"\n\n- name: Task 6: Import ssl.yml\n  include_tasks: ssl.yml\n  when: https_ssl_enable\n\n- name: Task 7: Import locations.yml\n  include_tasks: locations.yml\n  when: httpd_locations is defined\n\n- name: Task 8: Import vhosts.yml\n  include_tasks: vhosts.yml\n  when: httpd_vhosts is defined\n\n- name: Task 9: Configure ports\n  template:\n    src: httpd_ports_conf.j2\n    dest: "{{ httpd_server_root }}/httpd_ports_conf"\n    mode: 0644\n  when: ansible_os_family in [\'Debian\', \'Suse\']\n  notify: test httpd configuration and restart httpd\n\n- name: Task 10: Import directories.yml\n  include_tasks: directories.yml\n  when: httpd_directories is defined\n\n- name: Task 11: Flush handlers\n  meta: flush_handlers\n\n- name: Task 12: Removing default html\n  file:\n    path: "{{ httpd_data_directory }}/index.html"\n    state: absent\n  when: httpd_remove_example\n\n- name: Task 13: Start and enable httpd\n  service:\n    name: "{{ httpd_service }}"\n    state: started\n    enabled: yes\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-06T13:48:43.441954Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 22946592953, 'load_duration': 97033336, 'prompt_eval_count': 757, 'prompt_eval_duration': 437548441, 'eval_count': 1120, 'eval_duration': 22410832539, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--f4b80411-7944-4447-8ef1-2571e3edd4dc-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 757, 'output_tokens': 1120, 'total_tokens': 1877}
